WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.670
- OKAY,
LET'S GET THIS THING GOING.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.773
EVERYBODY TAKE A SEAT.

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:09.843
WE GOT TO HAVE
MORE MEETINGS, HOMES,

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:12.613
'CAUSE I'M TELLING YOU, MAN,
WE GOT TO GET ORGANIZED.

00:00:12.613 --> 00:00:14.281
[sighs]

00:00:14.281 --> 00:00:18.619
[police sirens in the distance]

00:00:24.892 --> 00:00:27.694
CARLITO AIN'T GOT A SEAT, MAN.
SOMEONE GET HIM A CHAIR.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:29.129
- NO, I'M COOL.

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:31.798
- NO, DUDE, GET HIM A CHAIR,
HOMES.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.703
- I'M GONNA SIT GANGSTER.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:39.439
- BUT, CARLITO, IT DOESN'T LOOK
LIKE IT'S COMFORTABLE, MAN.

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:42.042
WHY DON'T YOU
JUST SIT IN THE CHAIR?

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:44.278
- I NEVER SIT
IN NO CHAIR, ESE.

00:00:44.278 --> 00:00:46.146
MM-MMM.

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:49.917
YOU NEVER, EVER GON' CATCH ME
SITTING IN NO CHAIRS.

00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:51.818
- HEY, ESE, YOU KNOW THAT
THAT'S LOCO, RIGHT?

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:53.420
- NO, MAN.
[scoffs]

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:54.655
- IT'S COOL, CARLITO.

00:00:54.655 --> 00:00:56.356
NO ONE'S GONNA THINK
YOU'RE SOFT

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:57.991
IF YOU SIT IN A CHAIR, HOMES.
- YEAH, YEAH.

00:00:57.991 --> 00:00:59.526
- WE'RE ALL SITTING IN CHAIRS.
- RIGHT.

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:01.795
- BUNCH OF BITCH-ASS CULEROS.

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:03.463
- QUE?
- I DON'T HAVE NO TIME

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:05.966
TO SIT IN NO [bleep] CHAIR.

00:01:08.135 --> 00:01:10.337
- OKAY.

00:01:10.337 --> 00:01:12.973
NOW THAT WE'RE ALL HERE--

00:01:12.973 --> 00:01:14.508
YOU KNOW WHAT?
BUT WHY, THOUGH?

00:01:14.508 --> 00:01:17.411
LIKE, IT DON'T MAKE NO SENSE
FOR YOU TO SET YOURSELF UP

00:01:17.411 --> 00:01:18.979
WITH A RULE LIKE THAT.

00:01:18.979 --> 00:01:21.848
- NO, IT'S, LIKE, LIMITING.
- YEAH, LIMITING.

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:23.250
- LIMITING.
- I MEAN, SOMETIMES,

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:24.685
PEOPLE SIT IN CHAIRS.

00:01:24.685 --> 00:01:27.554
- MAN, [bleep] ALL OF YOU GUYS
WITH YOUR BITCH-ASS CHAIRS.

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:29.356
[wood cracks]

00:01:29.356 --> 00:01:32.960
- THERE.
- [scoffs]

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:36.663
- OKAY, CARLITO, QUIT PLAYING
AND SIT IN THE CHAIR, PENDEJO.

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:38.231
- NO.
- CARLITO,

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:41.335
WE HAVE TO HAVE THIS MEETING
NOW, ESE. GET UP!

00:01:41.335 --> 00:01:42.936
- I'M GOOD RIGHT HERE, MAN.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.671
- YOU KNOW--
- I'M CHILLING.

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:46.940
GO AHEAD WITH YOUR MEETING.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:49.943
- OKAY, BUT YOU KNOW
IT'S GOING TO BE WEIRD.

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:51.311
YOU DON'T CARE
THAT IT'S GOING TO BE WEIRD?

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:52.446
- WEIRD FOR YOU, MAYBE.

00:01:52.446 --> 00:01:54.815
- HE DOESN'T CARE.
OKAY.

00:01:54.815 --> 00:01:58.051
OKAY, HOMIES,
SO THIS IS WHAT WE HAVE TO DO,

00:01:58.051 --> 00:01:59.720
LIKE, WE GOT TO SELL
MORE DRUGS...

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:01.088
- [groaning]
- AND WE GOT TO MAKE

00:02:01.088 --> 00:02:02.456
MORE CRIMES HAPPEN.

00:02:02.456 --> 00:02:05.359
ROBERTO, WHERE ARE WE--
- [groaning]

00:02:05.359 --> 00:02:07.594
- CARLITO,
YOU'RE BLEEDING, ESE!

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:10.263
- [grunts]
WHO CARES, MAN?

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:13.900
[winces]

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.736
- YO, WHOA!
YOU JUST GOT SHANKED, MAN!

00:02:15.736 --> 00:02:18.038
WE GOT TO PULL THAT OUT!
- LEAVE IT!

00:02:18.038 --> 00:02:20.507
I'M CHILLING, HOMES.

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:23.910
I DON'T CARE
ABOUT THAT STUPID SHANK.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.279
[groaning]

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:27.481
[exhales]

00:02:27.481 --> 00:02:29.282
- CARLITO.

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:31.818
CARLITO, WAKE UP, MAN!

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:35.188
[radio chatter]

00:02:35.188 --> 00:02:36.623
- HEY,
DON'T EVEN BOTHER, ESE.

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:38.058
- WHAT?
[screams]

00:02:38.058 --> 00:02:39.626
OH, DIOS MIO!

00:02:39.626 --> 00:02:42.496
- I DON'T NEED
THOSE DEFIBRILLATORS.

00:02:42.496 --> 00:02:44.698
I DON'T EVEN WANT TO COME BACK
TO LIFE, HOMES.

00:02:44.698 --> 00:02:48.201
- CARLITO,
GO BACK INTO YOUR BODY.

00:02:48.201 --> 00:02:51.104
- MY BODY'S STUPID, HOMES.
- WHAT?

00:02:51.104 --> 00:02:53.607
- I'M FINE RIGHT HERE
ON THE SPIRIT PLANE.

00:02:53.607 --> 00:02:56.009
LIFE IS FOR PUSSIES.

00:02:56.009 --> 00:03:00.113
[heavenly singing]

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:04.184
- CARLITO.
CARLITO, GO TO THE LIGHT.

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:05.852
- NAH, I'M GOOD, MAN.

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:07.521
- CARLITO,
THAT'S HEAVEN, MAN.

00:03:07.521 --> 00:03:09.222
- I DON'T NEED TO GO
TO HEAVEN, HOMES.

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:11.792
HEAVEN IS FOR PUSSIES.
- OH, BOY.

